# Pursuit Of Clan Ambition (Q503): the leader of a level 4 clan takes Sir Gustav's quest, Martien sends
# the clan after the dwarf corpses' eggs (the corpses spawn NPCs, which a scenario cannot show: the Boot
# tests play them), the leader brings the last eggs from the monsters and hands all forty to Martien,
# and Sir Gustav gives the second letter. Each egg is an always-drop to the clan leader. Expectations
# replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q503_pursuit_of_clan_ambition_eggs.golden
character Leader 40
clan 4
random always 0
hold 3839 8
hold 3840 8
hold 3841 8
hold 3842 8
